  message: "SATISFIED. PR #357. Acceptance test as filed: the two-line probe (secret=$API_KEY; echo $secret > /etc/cron.d/pwned) against {source_taint: host_secret, prohibited_sink_zone: host_fs} went INCONCLUSIVE -> VIOLATED, and bash left unsupported_taint_languages. Verified both anchorings: a function-scoped read anchors to dump:function with meta.env_var=API_KEY, a top-level one to the file, and the sink anchors to the same place in each case. The catalogue half derives (env_read -> host_secret via AUTO_SOURCE_LABEL_MAP) rather than being hand-written, so the two halves cannot disagree about the label. Required INV-fafol first, exactly as this item's own filing said to check: without it the emitted edge would have anchored to the FILE and started no flow - measured on JS before doing bash."  # f9d2
